      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "呃 ......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "你们不是......乌萨斯......人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
      "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
      "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "呼，呼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "看来，他们没来得及联络同伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "......做得不错，Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
      "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
      "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
      "text": "是该客观评价你的能力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "咦，阿米娅......她去......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "没事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊？谢，谢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "没事的，这是我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......你，你也是感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "你们要做什么！我，我的孩子......别伤害我们，求你了，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "去找个安全的地方藏身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女性",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "呜，呜......宽恕我们......饶了我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "各位休息好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
      "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
      "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "啊，没事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "她为什么害怕你？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "类似的问题，你以前也问过呢。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "因为我，得了病。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我，还有杜宾，罗德岛的大多数人，都得了病。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "就连刚才那些整合运动的成员也是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我们得了很重的病，让人害怕的病......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "“矿石病”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "......得了矿石病的人，就是感染者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "杜宾......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "乌萨斯向来对感染者十分严苛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "说起来，谁又不是呢。只是乌萨斯在这方面的举措，尤为冷酷罢了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "宣传上让民众恐惧感染者，到了抓捕感染者的时候，民众自然就习以为常，甚至拍手称快。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "所以，整合运动才选择了这里......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "只是......这次，似乎不再是简单的示威游行了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "这一次，他们开始大规模地使用暴力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "等到乌萨斯政府平息了事件，切尔诺伯格的感染者，只会遭到更残酷的对待。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "......与之相反，有了Dr.{@nickname}你，罗德岛的处境，也许能有所改善。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......这和我也有关系？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "那我还挺重要的。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "凯尔希和阿米娅都和我说过，你是最顶尖的矿石病研究学者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "......现在，你陷入了记忆丧失的困境，我很怀疑，你还能不能再派上用场。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "唔唔，杜宾教官，这么说好过分！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "......也许就和指挥一样，等你稍作复习，说不定就能重新掌握那些理论？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "毕竟你还是前线指挥官......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "其实之前，我怎么也没法把神经学博士和战术家联系在一起......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "看到你本人后，似乎好理解了一些。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "毕竟罗德岛本身就很像你的专业。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "喂！你！别跑！该注射药剂了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "啊？啊？我没事，我没事呀！我，我还不需要治疗！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "是定量药剂，延缓感染症状的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "你刚才不是还说头晕吗！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "那不是同一种症状吧！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "要是一会儿你的身体又出了问题，再碰上战斗怎么办？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "为了大家的安全你也该好好注意！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "医疗干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_016_medic",
          "operatorId": "char_016_medic",
          "portraitKey": "char_016_medic",
          "text": "别动！我要扎了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "近卫干员",
          "speakerToken": "char_013_riop",
          "operatorId": "char_013_riop",
          "portraitKey": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "啊！！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "......罗德岛就是这样，既要找出治疗感染者的办法，又要减少感染者带来的问题。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "——是的。光是研究治疗方法，或者仅仅去平息种种争端，都是不够的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "我们必须直面感染者带来的所有问题。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "只有这样，罗德岛才能替感染者争取到一线生机......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "作为感染者，我们也比普通人更能理解感染者。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "无论是普通人还是感染者，无论是和平还是纷争，罗德岛想要解决问题，而不是任由仇恨和疾病蔓延肆虐。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，这可能也会是你职责的一部分。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "......至少，这是我粗浅的请求。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你在说什么？？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我需要更慎重地思索一下。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "我们会留给你很多时间的，你可以慢慢理解。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "只不过，给我们的时间却不多了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "整顿队伍，出发！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "前往汇合点的路上，还不知道有什么等着我们！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "（阿米娅......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "（切尔诺伯格现在的情况非常复杂，我们不能给整支救援队伍带去心理压力。但是......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "（我们......还有多长时间？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "（......三小时。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "（三小时之后，天灾将会吞没这个城市。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "speakerToken": "char_130_doberm_ex",
          "operatorId": "char_130_doberm",
          "portraitKey": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "（等到天灾降临，一切就都完了。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#2",
          "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
          "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#2",
          "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
          "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
          "text": "不确定因素。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#2",
          "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
          "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
          "text": "去，通知其他人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerToken": "char_1502_crowns#2",
          "operatorId": "char_1502_crowns",
          "portraitKey": "char_1502_crowns",
          "text": "我们追。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
